============================================================================
            $VER: CRAPS Dice ReadMe, v1.2 (3-Sep-97) by Dotoran!
============================================================================

What Is It?
~~~~~~~~~~~
    A small dice game for CNet 3.05c and 4.28d!

How to Install It?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

    Copy the "Craps" file somewhere on your system, like in DOORS:

How to Use It?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

    Add it as an ARexx PFile Door into your system. You could even create a
    command in BBSMENU like this one:

        CRAPS   `3-     |   {<path>Craps}
                 ^          ^   ^
             Accesses   Ctrl-Q  `-- Where you chose to store the file.

Closing
~~~~~~~
    Another quickie game by Dotoran! Hope you enjoy it! Oh, another file
    will be created, Craps.Highs, and will reside in the same directory
    you chose to store the main Craps file. ;-)

